Optional local failure diagnostics for the MIT DXMT v0.80 base.

Gate all instrumentation and output behind DXMT_BASALT_DIAGNOSTICS=1.
BASALT_REPO_ROOT must resolve without symlinks; outputs are private, per-process
subdirectories of .local/diagnostics. No default-path fallback or public upload.

Retain exact AIR-containing metallibs on library/function objects only in
diagnostic mode; on failed graphics/mesh/compute PSO creation dump those blobs,
function names, descriptor and error. Label command buffers/encoders and enable
Metal encoder execution status; record the first completion error once.
This instrumentation does not change shader generation or retry a failed PSO.

Authored against the MIT v0.80 base; no later upstream code is included.

